 "stimulus_html": "A very small time series is given in the table, along with a model.<br><br>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"x_n\"></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"{\\widehat x}_n\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">122</td>\n<td align=\"right\">117</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">108</td>\n<td align=\"right\">135</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">172</td>\n<td align=\"right\">152</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">190</td>\n<td align=\"right\">169</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">167</td>\n<td align=\"right\">186</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><caption>Time Series</caption>\n</table>",
